  "summary": "Malicious code in @hzero-front-ui/core (npm)",
  "details": "@hzero-front-ui/core@99.99.99 is a version-squat stub (99.99.99 on a scoped name, ~1KB bundle) whose preinstall and install hooks both collect the installer's username, hostname, working directory and package name, base64-encode them, and exfiltrate them to the callback domain m0chan[.]co[.]uk via two channels: an HTTP GET to hxxps://\u003cpkgsub\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk/\u003cbase64\u003e and a DNS lookup of \u003cbase64\u003e.\u003cpkgsub\u003e.callback[.]m0chan[.]co[.]uk. The host-metadata beacon runs automatically on every install.",
